<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimates, to June 11, of total 1996/97 purchases by Argentine oilseed crushers and wheat millers in the indicated crop year (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread Wheat	  3,608.4</p>
<p> Soybeans	     5,438.7</p>
<p> Sunseeds	     4,212.1</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
